(11,2,4,'2026-05-25','Explaining Advanced Kotlin Features','Learn to explain complex Kotlin-specific features like coroutines, extension functions, and smart casts, building on Day 3\'s OOP and functional concepts.','building','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 19:58:32','2026-05-22 19:58:32'),
