(18,3,4,'2026-05-25','Explaining Concurrency and High-Throughput Processing','Building on the transactional concepts from Day 2, master the English phrasing required to explain multithreading, race conditions, and thread safety in Java banking applications.','building','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 20:02:25','2026-05-22 20:02:25'),
(19,3,5,'2026-05-26','Conducting Code Reviews and Explaining Bug Fixes','Applying the API design concepts from Day 3 and concurrency concepts from Day 4, practice constructive English communication during code reviews and bug debugging sessions.','practice','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 20:02:25','2026-05-22 20:02:25'),
(20,3,6,'2026-05-27','Writing Technical Documentation for Banking Modules','Utilizing the debugging vocabulary from Day 5 and API concepts from Day 3, practice writing clear, professional technical documentation and system architecture summaries in English.','practice','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 20:02:25','2026-05-22 20:02:25'),
(21,3,7,'2026-05-28','System Design Presentation and Stakeholder Communication','Synthesizing the documentation skills from Day 6 and the technical discussions from Days 4 and 5, deliver a professional English presentation on a Java banking system design.','mastery','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 20:02:25','2026-05-22 20:02:25'),
(22,4,1,'2026-05-23','Pythonic Code & Core Terminology','Master intermediate data structures and idiomatic Python (PEP 8) while learning the precise English terminology used to describe clean code.','foundation','ready',10,'2026-05-23 05:46:53',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 05:46:34','2026-05-23 05:46:53'),
