(24,4,3,'2026-05-25','Advanced OOP & Class Design','Deepen your understanding of Object-Oriented Programming, building on the clean code and functional principles from Days 1 and 2 to design robust classes.','building','pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 05:46:34','2026-05-23 05:46:34'),
